      "value": "@{5a608a476e91f9643e46b709|full_name}: No I do not want a private room. I want exclusive rights for VR users to enter my worlds! Many of the desktop users are newbees or trolls or both. And those I have in my friends list could be invited or even better they could join because I have them in my list.",
