      "spam": false,
      "value": "Don't you think that it would be a negative impact on the community? Like it or not. Let's be honest here, if this option was added most VR users, if not all of them, would be in VR only rooms. Alienating a huge part of the community is not the right thing to do. But even then it wouldn't stop the toxicty! Not all vr players are angels, they could invite a toxic friend and ruin the whole purpose. Then you would have aliented the good desktop users. And have allowed the toxic ones to annoy vr users execlusvely. It just makes me kind of sad when I see a group of people being seperated from the majority because some of them are unwanted.",
