      "value": "@{58c6b3cc227a56787575ebb4|full_name}: yeah \nI made a mistake there. But my point stands, you want to seperate desktop users from vr users because some of them are toxic.CS:GO and vrchat are not the same game. You're not going to get the same enjoyment of playing a match with someone on CS:GO as meeting them on vrchat.. I'm not saying one is better than the other, I'm saying it's different.",
